    thinking: "**Analyzing Color Palette**\n\nI\'m currently focused on evaluating the provided color palette for frontend design. I\'m noting the specific hex codes and how they might work together, considering their names, and how they would look together in design, paying specific attention to how they may apply to different elements, like background, surfaces, text, and other elements. I\'m thinking of how they create a warm, earthy feel.\n\n\n**Considering Frontend Elements**\n\nI\'m now thinking about specific frontend components. I\'m focusing on text and border colors, with an eye toward typography, considering Playfair Display for headers and Inter for body text. I\'m also considering `recharts` for financial charts. I want to build a node dependency graph, and am checking the viability of `reactflow` or `@xyflow/react`. Let\'s also consider PWA requirements.\n\n\n"
