  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Requirements**\n\nI\'m currently dissecting the user\'s latest request, focusing on the homepage creation for Bandobast. I\'m prioritizing the features: new chat initiation, access to existing chats, and budget modification. I\'m also considering the integration of a generative AI element and the potential for context-aware suggestions for vendors (places, catering, photography). I am prioritizing the essential core functionality first.\n\n\n**Refining the Feature Set**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the \"Add voice conversations\" feature. The user\'s request for Gemini-3.8-live implementation is central, directly linked to this feature. I\'m assessing the best integration point and user experience. This also prompts me to re-examine my earlier prioritization, specifically the integration with budget modifications and context-aware suggestions, considering the new dynamic.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Chat Functionality**\n\nI\'m now focusing on integrating the \"New Chat\" button within the home hub. The ability to quickly adjust the budget directly from the chat interface is key, as is implementing quick event switchers and status updates. The \"Bandobast AI Advisor\" will be a dedicated chat interface with direct budget control and saved conversation access. I\'m prioritizing the AI\'s ability to recalculate and update the event budget in real time based on user adjustments.\n\n\n**Integrating Vendor Recommendations**\n\nI\'m now concentrating on seamlessly integrating vendor recommendations into the budget and event ledger. The ability for users to add suggested vendors with a single click is crucial. I\'m also working on the backend endpoints for AI chat and vendor recommendations, utilizing `@google/genai`. I\'m using the demo mode fallback for the API key to ensure smooth operation across different environments. My focus now is designing the homepage with an elegant Indian aesthetic and incorporating a hero banner and quick start options.\n\n\n"
