  planner_response {
    response: "### Bandobast \342\200\224 Home Page, AI Advisor & Budget-Based Vendor Recommender\n\nThe requested **Home Page**, **AI Advisor Chat with Session History**, and **Gen AI Place, Catering & Photography Recommender** have been integrated into Bandobast.\n\n---\n\n### What Was Built:\n\n#### 1. Home Hub & Conversation Launcher\n- **Welcome Hero:** Warm Indian celebratory greeting with quick-action cards to start planning, explore the Living Twin, or jump into the dashboard.\n- **Start New Chat & Old Chats History:**\n  - **\"Start New Chat\"** button opens a fresh conversation thread with Bandobast AI.\n  - **\"Conversations & Chats\"** list shows past planning sessions (e.g. *Jaipur Heritage Wedding Strategy*, *Food Catering & Live Counters Review*) with their active budget, message counts, and last message previews. Clicking any session resumes the chat.\n- **Interactive Budget Controller:**\n  - Real-time slider and numeric input to change the total celebration budget ceiling (e.g., \342\202\2713,00,000, \342\202\2715,00,000, \342\202\27110,00,000, \342\202\27125,00,000).\n  - Live preview of category allocations:\n    - **Catering (38%):** Dynamic calculation of cost per plate ($\\approx$ \342\202\271630/guest).\n    - **Venues & Mandap Lawns (22%)**\n    - **Photography & Cinema (13%)**\n    - **Decoration & Florals (16%)**\n    - **Contingency Buffer (11%)**\n  - **\"Apply to Event\"** button synchronizes the new budget across all living ledger views with celebratory confetti.\n\n#### 2. Gen AI Place, Catering & Photography Recommender\n- Uses `gemini-3.8-flash` via the official Google Gen AI SDK (with curated fallbacks for instant demo operation) to suggest the best vendors and places tailored to the organizer\'s exact budget:\n  - **Places & Venues:** *Heritage Haveli & Palace Courtyard*, *The Royal Palms Resort & Lawns* with capacity limits, pricing tiers, and direct manager contacts.\n  - **Food & Catering:** *Royal Rasoi Gourmet Caterers* (live Chaat & Jalebi-Rabdi stations, \342\202\271380\342\200\223\342\202\271440/plate) and *Annapurna Satvik Banquets* (pure vegetarian & Jain preparations).\n  - **Photography & Cinematography:** *ShutterMagic Cine Studios* (2 candid photographers + 4K cinematic teaser film & drone footage) and *Virasat Heritage Clicks*.\n  - **Decoration & Florals:** *Utsav Mandap & Floral Artistry* (Vedic marigold mandaps and fairy light curtains).\n- **1-Click \"Add to Event Budget\":** Injects the recommended venue, caterer, or photographer directly into the active event\'s budget ledger with data provenance tracking.\n\n#### 3. Interactive AI Advisor Chat (`/api/ai/chat`)\n- Dedicated chat view with a session switcher sidebar.\n- **In-Chat Budget Pill:** Shows the current budget at the top of the chat with an editable input to change budgets mid-conversation.\n- **Embedded Recommendation Cards:** When asking for places, catering menus, or photographers, recommendations appear inside the chat stream with match scores and 1-click \"Add to Budget\" buttons.\n- **Prompt Suggestions:** Quick chips for common questions (*\"Suggest top venues under \342\202\27175,000\"*, *\"What catering fits \342\202\271600/plate?\"*, *\"How should I allocate \342\202\2713,00,000?\"*).\n\n---\n\n### Verification\n- Both `npm test` (all 8 automated unit tests) and `tsc --noEmit` passed with 0 errors.\n- Applet compiled successfully and the dev server is running on port 3000."
    modified_response: "### Bandobast \342\200\224 Home Page, AI Advisor & Budget-Based Vendor Recommender\n\nThe requested **Home Page**, **AI Advisor Chat with Session History**, and **Gen AI Place, Catering & Photography Recommender** have been integrated into Bandobast.\n\n---\n\n### What Was Built:\n\n#### 1. Home Hub & Conversation Launcher\n- **Welcome Hero:** Warm Indian celebratory greeting with quick-action cards to start planning, explore the Living Twin, or jump into the dashboard.\n- **Start New Chat & Old Chats History:**\n  - **\"Start New Chat\"** button opens a fresh conversation thread with Bandobast AI.\n  - **\"Conversations & Chats\"** list shows past planning sessions (e.g. *Jaipur Heritage Wedding Strategy*, *Food Catering & Live Counters Review*) with their active budget, message counts, and last message previews. Clicking any session resumes the chat.\n- **Interactive Budget Controller:**\n  - Real-time slider and numeric input to change the total celebration budget ceiling (e.g., \342\202\2713,00,000, \342\202\2715,00,000, \342\202\27110,00,000, \342\202\27125,00,000).\n  - Live preview of category allocations:\n    - **Catering (38%):** Dynamic calculation of cost per plate ($\\approx$ \342\202\271630/guest).\n    - **Venues & Mandap Lawns (22%)**\n    - **Photography & Cinema (13%)**\n    - **Decoration & Florals (16%)**\n    - **Contingency Buffer (11%)**\n  - **\"Apply to Event\"** button synchronizes the new budget across all living ledger views with celebratory confetti.\n\n#### 2. Gen AI Place, Catering & Photography Recommender\n- Uses `gemini-3.8-flash` via the official Google Gen AI SDK (with curated fallbacks for instant demo operation) to suggest the best vendors and places tailored to the organizer\'s exact budget:\n  - **Places & Venues:** *Heritage Haveli & Palace Courtyard*, *The Royal Palms Resort & Lawns* with capacity limits, pricing tiers, and direct manager contacts.\n  - **Food & Catering:** *Royal Rasoi Gourmet Caterers* (live Chaat & Jalebi-Rabdi stations, \342\202\271380\342\200\223\342\202\271440/plate) and *Annapurna Satvik Banquets* (pure vegetarian & Jain preparations).\n  - **Photography & Cinematography:** *ShutterMagic Cine Studios* (2 candid photographers + 4K cinematic teaser film & drone footage) and *Virasat Heritage Clicks*.\n  - **Decoration & Florals:** *Utsav Mandap & Floral Artistry* (Vedic marigold mandaps and fairy light curtains).\n- **1-Click \"Add to Event Budget\":** Injects the recommended venue, caterer, or photographer directly into the active event\'s budget ledger with data provenance tracking.\n\n#### 3. Interactive AI Advisor Chat (`/api/ai/chat`)\n- Dedicated chat view with a session switcher sidebar.\n- **In-Chat Budget Pill:** Shows the current budget at the top of the chat with an editable input to change budgets mid-conversation.\n- **Embedded Recommendation Cards:** When asking for places, catering menus, or photographers, recommendations appear inside the chat stream with match scores and 1-click \"Add to Budget\" buttons.\n- **Prompt Suggestions:** Quick chips for common questions (*\"Suggest top venues under \342\202\27175,000\"*, *\"What catering fits \342\202\271600/plate?\"*, *\"How should I allocate \342\202\2713,00,000?\"*).\n\n---\n\n### Verification\n- Both `npm test` (all 8 automated unit tests) and `tsc --noEmit` passed with 0 errors.\n- Applet compiled successfully and the dev server is running on port 3000."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\206\002\n\203\002\001i\024}\023\306\321\345r\253Ss\244\v\020\347q\263\367\204(\212\211\3747\304\v\371\334\223\vk\334\303\223\251;\240\357\t#\345t\354\367\340\026\331^\323f\375\231\217\204\265\221\251\215$/0\rQ\344\032\320\243\252\\+\371Hr\205\245\231\243\230\227\261\"\225JC4\271j\367\234\336\223\263\037cD\231R|\313\251\240\314Z\253}\030\273v\347W\330\374B\032\016p0^\204\017\237\344\by\312hC\201\2447X\003f\232\375\233\253\347Ss\243\231\241:o\031\fX\246s[>\236\314\257\224T\201\206D\3135\205\256=\000F\330C\337I\037\233\036\036\003\032Y\321(\210\000\n\316\304\233\272\b*\356++L\245\202\260I\032\302~\375\240M\243\'\304\356@\"S\237\252\254\271\005\021\247S\232\351|=\213g[\r\005wQj\360\037\337\255\020\036.J\217\255\351v\211\270;\321\251\251\376i\r\302\250\360\320\204\256\017"
